# AWS Infrastructure Project (Terraform)

This is my Terraform project. It sets up a complete AWS cloud infrastructure with web servers, game servers, and a database cluster.

## What does this project build?

* **VPC Network:** 2 public subnets (for web) and 2 private subnets (for database).
* **Web Servers:** Auto Scaling Group behind an Application Load Balancer (scales up when CPU is busy).
* **Game & Database Servers:** EC2 instances for gaming and NoSQL database.
* **Security:** IAM roles, user groups, and secure access to S3 storage.

## Requirements

* [Terraform](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/downloads) (v1.2 or newer)
* [LocalStack](https://www.localstack.cloud/) (optional, if you want to test locally without paying AWS)

